   "baseline": 164.5,
   "size": 11.5,
   "font": "Manrope-Regular",
   "width": 521
  },
  {
   "page": 3,
   "text": "events run on Acme Tickets, with the charges that apply to paid tickets.",
   "x": 37.5,
   "y": 170.5,
   "baseline": 182.5,
   "size": 11.5,
   "font": "Manrope-Regular",
   "width": 376
  },
  {
   "page": 3,
   "text": "Free events carry no platform or payment gateway charges. For paid events the organiser chooses,",
   "x": 37.5,
   "y": 199,
   "baseline": 211,
   "size": 11.5,
   "font": "Manrope-Regular",
   "width": 520.5
  },
  {
   "page": 3,
   "text": "event by event, whether the participant or the organiser bears the charges.",
